              "who": "fan",
              "text": "lmao yeah total clown i was dying\n\nhey u didnt say biscuits story yet spill"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "Biscuit was this scrappy little kitten i rescued right before i moved to austin, rode shotgun the whole drive in my old civic fr"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "aw thats awesome max did the same on my road trip last year u like austin"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "Hes been my sidekick ever since, always knocking shit over"
