              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha max does that too knocks over my coffee every morning\n\nyeah austin cool? whats ur fav spot there"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "lmao dying at your boss exposing himself like that, what a move"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "hey u skipped the austin q again lol fav spot there? max just knocked over my plant smh"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "I did spill on Biscuit babe, rescued him right before the Austin move and he rode with me the whole way. Max sounds like a trooper too"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha yeah biscuits ride sounds epic but u still dodging austin lol fav bar or something? max is chilling now"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "austin's been good to me fr, love the vibe here. Where was your road trip last year tho"
