            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "road trip was to cali last summer max hated the car but loved the stops\n\nur fav austin thing vibe wise?"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "haha max is on a rampage today, biscuits always going for my plants too"
