            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha max is a menace with plants too\n\nstill curious bout that austin vibe whats ur fav thing there"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "fav spot in austin? lowkey the trails by lady bird lake, perfect for chilling after a long day fr"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "oh cool lady bird lake sounds chill ive never been\n\nwhats the vibe like on those trails"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "Where'd that road trip with max take u last year tho"
