              "text": "mines whiskers yeah hes pretty destructive knocks shit over constantly lol"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "Haha classic name for a chaos cat, sounds like he matches biscuit's energy fr. whatcha up to rn besides dodgin all that destruction"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "just chillin on the couch watchin netflix u"
            },
            {
