              "text": "i told u tech support lol whats urs besides this"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "Lol me? i do this fanvue gig now, quit bartendin a bit ago and havent looked back. tech support huh, whats the craziest issue uve dealt with lately"
